          "changelog": "- 命令契约门禁：13 条打开/定位/复制类命令补 `context` 载荷声明（`{ uri?, isDirectory?, filePath?, ext? }`），example 与 params 一致；无行为变化。",
          "sha256": "c55561245ab6f5a72776d9151e539b218b0d7db4fc377a34b021fc7b7dd62a46"
        },
        {
          "version": "1.0.41",
